'''Querm Rybet''' was a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[amphibian]] [[species]].

==Biology and appearance==
[[File:FrogLadySpecies.png|thumb|left|250px|A female of the species soaking in a hot spring]]
The Querm Rybet<ref name="SWE">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref> was an [[Amphibian|amphibious]] [[species]], capable of breathing both air and [[water]]. Their skin [[color]] could be pink<ref name="ThePassenger" /> or bluish-green.<ref name="Chapter11" /> When inside an [[egg]] they were a dark orange. The species was capable of and often engaged in bipedal locomotion, but they could hop, which allowed them to move faster. They also had long tongues which could be used to grab things quickly.<ref name="ThePassenger" />

Querm Rybets' eggs could not travel in [[hyperspace]], as it would [[Death|kill]] them.<ref name="ThePassenger" />

The Querm Rybets shared a name with the [[Rybet]]s, another frog-like sentient amphibious species.<ref name="Thrawn: Alliances">''[[Thrawn: Alliances]]''</ref>

==Society and culture==
They laid eggs in which more frogs were born. The eggs needed to be fertilized by a [[Gender|male]]. These eggs were edible by [[Yoda's species]].<ref name="ThePassenger" /> After hatching, tadpoles would emerge from the egg. The tadpoles would start to form arms and legs and take on an orange color as well as tiny spikes on their backs.<ref name="Chapter11" /> At least two members of the species [[Language|spoke]] [[Frog (language)|Frog]], which involved the use of clicks and groans. It could also be learned and spoken by [[Human]]s; [[Peli Motto]] was able to speak the language.<ref name="ThePassenger" />

==History==
In [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{MandoDate|12}}</ref> a frog nicknamed "[[Frog Lady]]" was attempting to get to [[Trask]], where her [[Frog Man|husband]] found a place to live.<ref name="ThePassenger" /> They eventually made it to the [[moon]] where they resided in [[Frog Lady and Frog Man's home|their home]].<ref name="Chapter11" />

In [[34 ABY]],<ref name="34 ABY">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]'' dates the [[Battle of Batuu]] to [[34 ABY]].</ref> a Querm Rybet visited the [[Creature Stall]] on [[Batuu]].<ref name="Batuu Adventure">''[[Star Wars: Galaxy's Edge: A Batuu Adventure!]]''</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
The species was first mentioned in "[[Chapter 10: The Passenger]]," the second episode of the [[The Mandalorian Season Two|second season]] of the [[Disney+]] television series ''[[Star Wars: The Mandalorian]]''.<ref name="ThePassenger" /> The species was named for the first time in the 2024 sourcebook ''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''.<ref name="SWE" />

